  "details": "This isn't really a SDK bug report but it's also open beta feedback so I'm unsure of where I'm supposed to put it? Feel free to bump this into the correct category.\n\nCamera thumbnails should not entirely vanish! The scene view capture is nice but some of us had camera setups for consistent avatar thumbnails. It would be nice to have a thumbnail option for \"Capture From Camera\" with a selector.\n\nI personally parent constrained the camera to my head so it and the title text would end up in the same exact height for every different outfit/variation of the avatar.",
